# The signs (docs/SCREENS.md 6.1, part s2cap): a level load from the
# menu's new game (the busy sign "LOADING...", bmSignLoading and its
# bmSignOff), then the level cheat to the intermission, its counts and
# the world-done load (F_LoadScreen, then E1M2's sign).

wait d_main65.s:pagedrawn == 1 within 90s   # the title page is up
at +1s press escape                     # a new game at the default skill
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 1
at +10f press return
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 2 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 2 within 1
at +10f press return
wait _g_usergame == 1 within 10s
wait _g_gamestate == 0 within 10s
wait long _g_gametic grows 1 within 60s # E1M1 is loaded
at +2s note e1m1
at +1s type idclev                      # the level ends
wait _g_gamestate == 1 within 30s       # the intermission
at +3s press space                      # the counts at once
at +2s press space                      # the next map: F_LoadScreen
wait _g_gamestate == 0 within 30s
wait long _g_gametic grows 1 within 60s # E1M2 is loaded
wait _g_gamemap == 2 within 1
at +2s note e1m2
stop
